  "goodToKnow": "Handwerklich means relating to crafts or manual skill: handwerklich begabt (good with one's hands), handwerkliche Ausbildung. It can also mean technically, as in craftsmanship: handwerklich solide, but uninspired. Das Handwerk is the skilled trades; many trades in Germany require a Meisterbrief (master craftsman's certificate) to run a business. Handwerk hat goldenen Boden is an old saying: a trade is a secure living."
